   \[
   \text{Moles} = 3.00 \, \text{M} \times 20.0 \, \text{L} = 60.0 \, \text{ moles}
   \]

4. **Calculate the moles of \( H_2SO_4 \) that need to be added**:
   \[
   \text{Moles to add} = \text{Final moles} - \text{Initial moles} = 60.0 - 40.0 = 20.0 \, \text{ moles}
   \]

