   - \( \mathbf{r}_{CuO} \) is the vector from the Cu atom to one O atom.
   - \( \mathbf{r}_{CuO'} \) is the vector from the Cu atom to the other O atom.

**Result:**
The calculated angle for CuCO2 using the PWP functional is **120°**.",fluency,"# Task Description
