\[
P(X = 12) = \binom{12}{12} (0.5)^{12} (0.5)^{12 - 12} = \binom{12}{12} (0.5)^{12} (0.5)^0 = 1 \times (0.5)^{12} = 1 \times \frac{1}{4096} = \frac{1}{4096}
\]

Summing these probabilities:
\[
