\[
\frac{\partial P}{\partial z} = 0, \quad \frac{\partial Q}{\partial z} = 0, \quad \frac{\partial R}{\partial z} = 0.
\]
Substituting these into the curl formula:
\[
\nabla \times \mathbf{V} = \left( \frac{\partial 0}{\partial y} - \frac{\partial Q}{\partial 0} \right) \mathbf{i} - \left( \frac{\partial 0}{\partial x} - \frac{\partial P}{\partial 0} \right) \mathbf{j} + \left( \frac{\partial P}{\partial x} - \frac{\partial Q}{\partial x} \right) \mathbf{k}.
